{"toolCallId":"call_cce5131df9f64e1986d6e8a83dcebfc1","status":"completed","content":[{"type":"content","content":{"type":"text","text":"FAIL — 52 placeholder pattern(s) found in specs/zz-bench-authoring/001-recommend-level-quiet-flag\n\n  specs/zz-bench-authoring/001-recommend-level-quiet-flag/acceptance-criteria.md:19: [SESSION-ID]\n  specs/zz-bench-authoring/001-recommend-level-quiet-flag/acceptance-criteria.md:39: [PACKET-ID]\n  specs/zz-bench-authoring/001-recommend-level-quiet-flag/acceptance-criteria.md:41: [Draft/In Progress/Complete]\n  specs/zz-bench-authoring/001-recommend-level-quiet-flag/acceptance-criteria.md:79: [Yes/No]\n  specs/zz-bench-authoring/001-recommend-level-quiet-flag/implementation-summary.md:59: [Created/Modified/Deleted]\n  specs/zz-bench-authoring/001-recommend-level-quiet-flag/implementation-summary.md:77: [What was decided]\n  specs/zz-bench-authoring/001-recommend-level-quiet-flag/implementation-summary.md:87: [Validation, lint, tests, manual check]\n  specs/zz-bench-authoring/001-recommend-level-quiet-flag/implementation-summary.md:95: [Limitation]\n  specs/zz-bench-authoring/001-recommend-level-quiet-flag/plan.md:57: [Component 1]\n  specs/zz-bench-authoring/001-recommend-level-quiet-flag/plan.md:58: [Component 2]\n  specs/zz-bench-authoring/001-recommend-level-quiet-flag/plan.md:61: [Brief description of how data moves through the system]\n  specs/zz-bench-authoring/001-recommend-level-quiet-flag/plan.md:99: [Components/functions]\n  specs/zz-bench-authoring/001-recommend-level-quiet-flag/plan.md:100: [API endpoints/flows]\n  specs/zz-bench-authoring/001-recommend-level-quiet-flag/plan.md:101: [User journeys]\n  specs/zz-bench-authoring/001-recommend-level-quiet-flag/plan.md:111: [System/Library]\n  specs/zz-bench-authoring/001-recommend-level-quiet-flag/plan.md:119: [Conditions requiring rollback]\n  specs/zz-bench-authoring/001-recommend-level-quiet-flag/plan.md:120: [How to revert changes]\n  specs/zz-bench-authoring/001-recomm