{"toolCallId":"call_ce1ca255167d479aa693bbc5cebe3e62","status":"completed","content":[{"type":"content","content":{"type":"text","text":"[\n  'spec.md',\n  'plan.md',\n  'tasks.md',\n  'implementation-summary.md',\n  'decision-record.md',\n  'before-after.md',\n  'timeline.md',\n  'roadmap.md',\n  'metadata',\n  'problem',\n  'scope',\n  'requirements',\n  'success-criteria',\n  'risks',\n  'questions',\n  'non-functional-requirements',\n  'edge-cases',\n  'complexity-assessment',\n  'risk-matrix',\n  'user-stories',\n  'acceptance-criteria.md',\n  'goal.md'\n]\nspec.md: metadata, problem, scope, requirements, success-criteria, risks, questions, nfr, edge-cases, complexity, risk-matrix, user-stories\nplan.md: summary, quality-gates, architecture, phases, testing, dependencies, rollback, affected-surfaces, phase-deps, effort, enhanced-rollback, ai-execution, architecture-overview, risk-mitigation\ntasks.md: notation, phase-1, phase-2, phase-3, completion, cross-refs, architecture-tasks, protocol, pre-impl, code-quality, testing, fix-completeness, security, docs, file-org, summary, arch-verify, perf-verify, deploy-ready, compliance-verify, docs-verify, sign-off\nimplementation-summary.md: metadata, what-built, how-delivered, decisions, verification, limitations, architecture-summary\ndecision-record.md: adr-001, adr-001-context, adr-001-decision, adr-001-alternatives, adr-001-consequences, adr-001-five-checks, adr-001-impl\nbefore-after.md: metadata, summary, comparison, net-effect, notes-caveats\ntimeline.md: metadata, timeline, milestones\nroadmap.md: metadata, now-next-later, milestones-targets, dependencies\nmetadata: \nproblem: \nscope: \nrequirements: \nsuccess-criteria: \nrisks: \nquestions: \nnon-functional-requirements: \nedge-cases: \ncomplexity-assessment: \nrisk-matrix: \nuser-stories: \nacceptance-criteria.md: metadata, criteria, closure\ngoal.md: directive, completion, log\n"}}],"_meta":{"cognition.ai/cwd":"/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-michelkerkmeeste